SCROLL OF SEALS — RESTRICTED INVENTORY
Konohagakure Forbidden Archive — Hokage seal required

The Scroll of Seals (Scroll of Forbidden Seals) contains techniques too
dangerous for general practice, sealed since the village's founding. It
is stored in the most secure chamber of the Hokage's residence.

Catalogued Contents (partial, redacted):
- Shadow Clone Technique (Multiple) — forbidden by mass chakra cost.
- Impure World Reincarnation (Edo Tensei) — see ban notice.
- Reaper Death Seal — soul-sealing kinjutsu; lethal to the caster.
- Additional sealing and summoning kinjutsu — sealed.

Security Note: This scroll was once stolen from the archive; the theft
resulted in the exposure and death of the traitor Mizuki and the
graduation of Naruto Uzumaki, who learned the Shadow Clone from it.
Handling procedures were tightened thereafter.

Access is logged. Removal requires the Hokage's personal authorization.
